{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_mana_hex","model_identifier":"spell_mana_hex","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_mana_hex\n\nMana hex: a violet ring on the ground, radius 16 u at scale 1; the game expands it outward from the caster to 10 m (356 u, scale about 22).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -17..17, y 0..1, z -17..17 units (0.97 x 0.02 x 0.97 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 40.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 35 x 1 x 35 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_ring0, glow_ring1, glow_ring10, glow_ring11, glow_ring12, glow_ring13, glow_ring14, glow_ring15, glow_ring16, glow_ring17, glow_ring18, glow_ring19 ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"glow_ring0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[14.75,0.0,-2.75],"to":[17.25,0.6,2.75],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6.75,6.4,9.25,7.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[5.25,0.4,10.75,1.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[6.75,6.4,9.25,7.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[5.25,0.4,10.75,1.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.75,0.25,3.25,5.75],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.75,0.25,3.25,5.75],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7d50808b-1531-5329-b231-be7c7a61852d"},{"name":"glow_ring1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":tru